{
 "total": 39.055,
 "frases": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "a": 0.15,
   "b": 2.008,
   "texto": "That swing is about to drop you on your back!",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "a": 2.128,
   "b": 4.822,
   "texto": "Hit like and follow. Flo hung this one in five minutes!",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "a": 4.942,
   "b": 7.415,
   "texto": "Two screw hooks into the porch ceiling. Easy!",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "a": 7.535,
   "b": 10.101,
   "texto": "Into the ceiling boards? Those aren't holding anything up.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "a": 10.221,
   "b": 14.121,
   "texto": "And a screw hook only grips with its threads. Every swing pulls it a little looser.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "a": 14.241,
   "b": 15.5,
   "texto": "It held me yesterday!",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "a": 15.62,
   "b": 19.199,
   "texto": "Swinging adds force. Bounce a little, and it all lands on those threads.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "a": 19.319,
   "b": 21.355,
   "texto": "Okay, okay. What's the right way?",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "a": 21.475,
   "b": 25.1,
   "texto": "Find the joist above the ceiling. Use an eye bolt that goes all the way through it.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "a": 25.22,
   "b": 28.774,
   "texto": "Washer and nut on top. Now the wood carries the load, not the threads.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "a": 28.894,
   "b": 32.046,
   "texto": "And use closed hooks or quick links, so the chain can't jump off.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "a": 32.166,
   "b": 33.889,
   "texto": "Fine. I'll go find the joist.",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "a": 34.009,
   "b": 36.878,
   "texto": "Screw hooks, or through bolts? Team Norm or Team Flo?",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "a": 36.998,
   "b": 39.055,
   "texto": "Follow for more backyard builds that won't fail!",
   "h": 0
  }
 ],
